WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.729 --> 00:00:09.096
This tutorial shows how to add a staff member. Everything you see uses fictional

2
00:00:09.096 --> 00:00:10.608
demonstration data.

3
00:00:11.062 --> 00:00:18.517
On the Users page, select New staff. You can also choose Add Staff from your account

4
00:00:18.517 --> 00:00:18.961
menu.

5
00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:26.053
Step one covers personal and employment details: the name, job role, employment type

6
00:00:26.053 --> 00:00:27.948
and default hourly rate.

7
00:00:29.494 --> 00:00:36.613
Step two holds the contact details. The invitation is sent to this email address.

8
00:00:38.156 --> 00:00:41.675
Step three records an emergency contact.

9
00:00:45.504 --> 00:00:52.358
Step four sets availability: working days, preferred shift times, and the maximum

10
00:00:52.358 --> 00:00:53.627
hours per week.

11
00:00:54.083 --> 00:01:00.956
Select Create. Crewflow creates the staff record and queues an invitation email.

12
00:01:01.421 --> 00:01:07.203
The new staff member's details open. Their status shows the invitation until they

13
00:01:07.203 --> 00:01:10.059
accept it and sign in to the mobile app.
